      "title": "Test Judge",
      "description": "On: a small model reads the lines that a call adds to a test file that exists, and an added line that makes a test weaker asks. Each check is one Haiku call of at most about 5,000 tokens. Off: the added lines get no check, and a lost or changed line still asks.",
      "default": true
    },
    "decide": {
      "type": "string",
